note.p:
“Concurred in by the United States Intelligence Board on 12 November 1958.
                    Concurring were The Director of Intelligence and Research, Department of State;
                    the Assistant Chief of Staff for Intelligence, Department of the Army; the
                    Assistant Chief of Naval Operations for Intelligence, Department of the Navy;
                    the Assistant Chief of Staff, Intelligence, USAF; the Director for Intelligence,
                    The Joint Staff; the Assistant to the Secretary of Defense, Special Operations;
                    and the Director of the National Security Agency. The Atomic Energy Commission
                    Representative to the USIB and the Assistant Director, Federal Bureau of
                    Investigation, abstained, the subject being outside of their jurisdiction.”
